<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24340" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">inter-miscĕo</span></b> , scui, xtum, or
			stum, 2, v. a., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>to mix among</i>, <i>intermix.</i>—With dat. (not in Cic. or
			Cæs.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">tibi undam,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					E. 10, 5</span></i>
			; so, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">aliquid alicui,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Col.
					11, 3, 57</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">turbam indignorum dignis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Liv. 4,
					56</span></i>
			.—With abl.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">intermixti hostibus cognoscunt, etc.,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Liv.
					10, 20</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">classe captiva intermixtis mulieribus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Just.
					2, 8, 3</span></i>
			. — <b>
				<i>Absol.</i>
			</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">turbabant equos pedites intermixti,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Liv.
					21, 46</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Scrib. Comp. 207</span></i>.</div>
